    <string name="tutorial_title">TUTORIAL</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step">STEP %1$d OF %2$d</string>
    <string name="tut_title_one">PICK A BLOCK</string>
    <string name="tut_body_one">Tap one of the three cards, then tap the drop button. Wide and light keeps the spire straight, heavy and narrow buys armour and costs tilt.</string>
    <string name="tut_title_two">PATCH THE CRACKS</string>
    <string name="tut_body_two">Tap any cracked floor while you are building to spend one mortar. The floor gains 40 integrity and the spire straightens by 3.</string>
    <string name="tut_title_three">KNOCK THEM OFF</string>
    <string name="tut_body_three">Tap a raider while it climbs. Every intercept returns one mortar. Raiders that land bite into a floor and shove the spire off plumb.</string>
    <string name="tut_title_four">WATCH THE PLUMB</string>
    <string name="tut_body_four">Tilt at 100 brings the spire down, and fewer than three floors does the same. The rail on the right is your warning.</string>

